    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νευροσπαστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put in motion by strings,</i> of puppets, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				34.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				7.3
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			): esp. metaph., <i>draw as by a string,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Hom.</u>
				p.62
			</span></i> O.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φαντασία σύρει ἡμᾶς καὶ ν. πρὸς
