					M.Ant.
					6.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be caught by drawing a string,</i> of birds,
				<i><span class="en">
